The Equational Theories Project
https://github.com/teorth/equational_theories
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The files

    engine/data/parsimagma/implications.bits.gz
    engine/data/parsimagma/hard_core.txt
    engine/data/parsimagma/summary.tsv

are derived from that project's implication data at upstream commit
e5a88a1479011ece4aad8e3c2e7e5c0ebc0a5b2a, by way of parsimagma, which packed it
into the bit formats described in engine/data/parsimagma/PROVENANCE.txt.
engine/data/parsimagma/corpus_signatures.bin.gz and corpus_index.tsv are
parsimagma's own computation, indexed by the project's numbering of its 4694 laws. The
underlying solver output is data/2025-08-11-vampire.json.gz (Janota,
arXiv:2508.15856). No source code from the Equational Theories Project is
included; the data is used as a known-results oracle and is unmodified apart
from the repacking recorded in PROVENANCE.txt.

